---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Temecula Wine Country"
  description="About Bellie Acres Wine — independent Temecula Valley winery directory helping visitors plan tastings, maps, events, and balloon rides."
>
  <Navbar />

  <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-6xl font-serif tracking-tight mb-8">About Bellie Acres Wine</h1>

    <div class="space-y-6 text-lg text-stone-700 leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        <strong>Bellie Acres Wine</strong> (bellieacreswine.com) is an independent online directory for Temecula Valley
        wine country. We help visitors discover tasting rooms, compare practical details (pets, kids, price feel, varietals),
        browse a map, check event listings, and explore sunrise balloon operators that pair well with a wine-country trip.
      </p>

      <p>
        Temecula Valley is one of Southern California’s most accessible wine destinations — more than forty wineries
        set in the rolling hills of Riverside County, roughly an hour from many coastal and inland cities depending on traffic.
        A unique mix of elevation, marine influence, and diverse soils supports everything from crisp whites and sparkling
        programs to bold reds and Mediterranean-inspired blends.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl text-stone-900 pt-6">Our mission</h2>
      <p>
        Planning a first visit should not require twenty browser tabs. We organize estate-level snapshots so you can build
        a realistic half-day or full-day route: who is pet-friendly, where families fit, which houses lean sparkling versus
        Cabernet, and how to move between stops without guesswork.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl text-stone-900 pt-6">What we are / are not</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
        <li>We <strong>are</strong> an independent guide and directory.</li>
        <li>We are <strong>not</strong> the official site of any single winery unless clearly labeled.</li>
        <li>We do <strong>not</strong> process alcohol sales on this website.</li>
        <li>Hours, fees, and policies change — always confirm with the business before you go.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl text-stone-900 pt-6">Visit responsibly</h2>
      <p>
        Alcohol service is for adults 21+. Designate a driver, use rideshare, or book a wine-country shuttle if you plan
        multiple tastings. Many estates offer beautiful grounds, food programs, and non-alcoholic options — ask on site.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl text-stone-900 pt-6">Corrections & contact</h2>
      <p>
        Own a listing or spot outdated info? Email <a class="text-[var(--accent)] underline" href="mailto:lauradfarley@gmail.com">lauradfarley@gmail.com</a>
        or use our <a class="text-[var(--accent)] underline" href="/contact">contact page</a>. Privacy details live on our
        <a class="text-[var(--accent)] underline" href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
